    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my monstera deliciosa has been acting weird lately. some of the lower leaves are turning this sickly yellow color and kind of drooping. i'm not sure if i'm watering it too much or if it needs more food or something? any idea what might be happening?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
