    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i checked the soil and it actually feels pretty dry, so i don't think i'm overwatering it. i've been really careful with it. but the yellowing is still getting worse and it's almost like the plant just looks... i don't know, drained? like it's losing its energy or something. is there anything else that could cause it to look so pathetic like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
